abstract: >-
  A production-ready technical framework and optimization hub engineered 
  specifically for modern visibility spaces. This repository serves as a live 
  blueprint for maximizing programmatic indexation, semantic entity linking, 
  and cross-platform discovery saturation. It bridges the gap between 
  traditional search engine crawl requirements (SEO), AI system prompt ingestion 
  standards (AEO), and Generative Engine Optimization semantic structures (GEO).
